# interplay_session_orders_tasks_first: The same session built in different orders: displays before tasks, tasks (and their work) before any display page, and the two interleaved, with 1, 2 or 3 tasks on different FIFOs. Whatever the order, every task's work gives the bytes the first task's does (each compared with a fresh run of the same seed), and each ends in orderly teardown.
